      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Công tắc thông minh Matter & WiFi Tuya, Star Grand Luxury Series Full-Touch 10A 2200W Power Load, Neutral Required chuẩn chữ nhật US</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><p>Description</p>\n<p>The Future of Connectivity: Matter-Enabled Lighting<br>Step into the next generation of smart living with the MOES Star Grand Series Matter Smart Switch. By supporting the universal Matter protocol, this switch eliminates the walls between ecosystems. Whether you use Siri, Alexa, or Google Assistant, this switch responds instantly, providing a unified and stable smart home experience like never before.</p>\n<p>Full-Surface Touch &amp; Premium Aesthetics<br>The Star Grand Series isn't just a switch; it's a design statement. The full-touch panel offers a premium feel compared to standard mechanical buttons. Its minimalist, elegant look complements any modern interior while providing the most intuitive manual control available on the market today.</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Matter Native Compatibility:</b> Experience true smart home unity. Seamlessly connect across Apple Home, Google Home, Alexa, and Samsung SmartThings simultaneously without any third-party bridges.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Star Grand Full-Touch Panel:</b> Breaking the limits of traditional buttons, the entire surface responds to your touch with ultra-high sensitivity, offering a sleek, modern, and effortless control experience.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2200W High Power Load:</b> Built for heavy-duty performance. Safely control large chandeliers, expansive outdoor lighting, or high-power ceiling fans up to 10A/2200W without risk of overload.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Neutral Wire Design:</b> Engineered for maximum stability. The required neutral wire ensures zero LED flickering and provides a more reliable electrical circuit for long-term smart home safety.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Industrial-Grade Durability:</b> Built to last with high-quality components. Rigorously tested for over 100,000+ cycles, ensuring sensitive and stable response even after years of intensive daily use.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Specifications</p>\n<p>SKU: MWS-SG-US<br>Model: WS12SG<br>Voltage: 90-250V AC, 50/60Hz<br>Max. Current: 10A/Gang; Total 10A INC <br>Wireless Protocol: Matter WiFi<br>Frequency Band: 2.412-2.484GHz<br>Maximum Radio Transmit Power: &lt;+16dBm</p>",
