      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Zigbee Công tắc ngữ cảnh không dây Tuya Zigbee - 3 Gang 9 Scenarios Smart Push Button Remote, Magnetic Handheld Design</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><p>Description</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Home Control in the Palm of Your Hand</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Tired of opening your phone every time you want to dim the lights? The MOES Zigbee 3-Gang Scene Switch brings physical convenience back to your smart home. This compact, wireless remote acts as a \"physical dashboard,\" allowing you to execute complex automation routines without ever touching an app.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Designed for Every Corner of Your Life</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Unlike fixed smart switches, our Magnetic Design adapts to you. Keep the base by the front door for an \"Away Mode\" toggle, but detach the remote and take it to the sofa for \"Cinema Mode\" control. Its sleek, minimalist aesthetic blends into any decor, from modern apartments to traditional bedrooms.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Features</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One Switch, 9 Intelligent Commands:</b> Maximize your home automation with 3 tactile buttons. Each button supports <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Single Press, Double Press, and Long Press</b>, allowing you to trigger up to 9 unique scenes—from \"Movie Night\" to \"All Lights Off\"—with a single device.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detachable Magnetic Design:</b> Experience ultimate flexibility. The switch module magnetically attaches to its wall base but can be detached in a second. Use it as a traditional wall switch, stick it to the fridge, or keep it on your nightstand as a handheld remote.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seamless Zigbee 3.0 Connectivity:</b> Powered by the ultra-low power Zigbee protocol, ensuring a faster, more stable connection than Wi-Fi. <i data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"136\">Note: Requires a Tuya/MOES Zigbee Gateway for full smart functionality.</i></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">365-Day Ultra-Long Battery Life:</b> Powered by a standard CR2032 battery, this remote offers up to<strong> </strong>12 months of daily use without replacement. The energy-efficient design ensures your smart home is always responsive, even during internet fluctuations.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero-Wiring, Tool-Free Installation:</b> Perfect for renters and DIY enthusiasts. No rewiring or electrical knowledge needed. Stick it anywhere using the included adhesive or carry it with the lanyard. Setup is complete in under 5 minutes via the Smart Life/Tuya App.</p>\n<p>Specifications:</p>\n<p>Model: ZT-YK01<br>Input Power: CR 2032 button battery<br>Communication: Zigbee 3.0<br>Dimension: 118*72*16.2mm<br>Standby current: 20uA<br>Working Temperature: -10℃~45℃<br>Working Humidity: &lt;90%RH<br>Button lifecycle: 500K<br>Frequency Band: 2.405-2.480GHz<br>Maximum Radio Transmit Power: &lt; +10dBm</p>\n<p>Packing List:</p>\n<p>Product*1<br>Manual*1<br>Installation screws*2<br>Backing glue*2</p>",
