      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES ZigBee Smart E14 Candle LED Light Candle Bulb 5W RGBCCT 2200-6500K Alexa Google Voice Control</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"description_describe\" id=\"describe\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"row dsc_1\">\n<h3 data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"col-lg-4\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\">Main Features<br>\n</h3>\n</div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"row dsc_2\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"col-lg-8 dsc_2\">\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<p><strong>ZigBee Smart Candle Bulb:</strong> Dimmable light in 16 million colors and wide-range color temp compatible with various scenes with smart control, decorating your house individually by smart way.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Adjustable Brightness and Color Temp:</strong> Through the MOES APP, you can adjust the brightness color temperature from 2200K to 6500K. The gradual changes is friendly to your eyes, in case the uncomfort by quick changes.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>16 Million Colors to Choose:</strong> 16 million colors of light can satisfy various needs. The romantic-atmosphere colorful light brings you a new experience of intelligent life.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Multiple Customized Scenes:</strong> 8 life scenes with different brightness and darkness can be chosen individually. In each scene, you can enjoy light colors with a special atmosphere.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Biological Rhythm:</strong> The bulb can be turned on or off according to a preset schedule, to help you build a healthy biological clock and be sober during the day while relax at night.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Timer Mode:</strong> The bulb can be turned on or off according to a preset schedule, to help you build a healthy biological clock and be sober during the day while relax at night.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Remote Control by App:</strong> No matter at home or outside, you can control the home lights through the mobile phone, scene mode, to play a real-time control role, can also easily adjust or switch the home lights outside.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>No disturb from power cut: </strong>Open the \"do not disturb\" mode when the light is off. When the power is cut and recover after a while, the light will not be auto-on unless the button is pressed twice within 5 seconds.<br><strong>Note:</strong> If the \"do not disturb\" mode is on/off successfully, the light will flash once and you can turn on the light only after flashing twice.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Wide-range Color Temp:</strong> Wide range of color temperature provides bright RGB colors for your home and plenty of good light.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Intelligent Voice Control:</strong> Activate and adjust the light via voice assistant such as Google Home and Alexa , to control the on/ off, color temp/brightness and etc, making you life easier by hands free.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Light Sync with Music:</strong> Interactive effects between sound and light: the light effects can be changed with the music melody, to specially create different atmosphere for you under different moods.<br>Note: Please keep in music mode interface when using it. Android system supports background running while IOS system not.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Easy Installation with E14 Base:</strong> MOES smart candle bulb is equipped with E14 standard base, for easy installation, reducing the trouble of complex installation to you.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Whole House Intelligence by Group Control:</strong> Install smart candle bulb in any room at your home and operate your phone for group control with one touch. Also you can control each light bulb separately.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
