      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Smart RF433 Transmitter Push Button Switch Multi-Control Self-powered EU</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Main Features:</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1.Wireless Remote Control:</strong>Control your electrical applications with the wall panel transmitter within the range required.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2.No Wi-Fi/Battery to Control:</strong>With the self power generation feature of the Wall Panel Remote Transmitter Switch,you are able to remotely control the devices connected to the RF433 Relay Receivers without WiFi or battery,as long as match the switch to the receiver in advance.Also,the rocker push button enables a lot convenience to your smart life.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3.Multi-Functinal Switch:</strong>One Wall Panel Remote Transmitter Switch is able to control multiple RF433 Relay Receivers,and multiple Wall Panel Remote Transmitter Switches can also control one RF Relay Receivers at the same time.Stick the switch with the double-sided tape include.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">4.Customer Protection:</strong>60 days refund guarantee and return for any reasons within 15 days.ce,CCC ,RoHS Listed.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>5.Attention:</strong>The RF433 Relay Receiver and the Wall Panel Remote Transmitter Switch must be used together with the same type,so you can't buy one receiver or one switch alone,or use the self generating wall panel transmitter to connect with other type of receiver.<img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_display_6d290eb0-c870-48b0-b41e-fb2cd1834f45.jpg?v=1585036012\" alt=\"\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_display_6d290eb0-c870-48b0-b41e-fb2cd1834f45.jpg?v=1585036012\"></p>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_1_92065318-8368-4aae-ad55-3100f489c578.jpg?v=1670384852\"></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_2_0becafd7-5ad2-407f-8282-88045c97c4e3.jpg?v=1670384829\"></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br></div>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Q&amp;A:</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1.Q：Do I need to control the devices with battery ?</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A: Certainly no need.This is a kind of switch with the self-generating feature.A battery is not required.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2. Q:Can a 2 Gang Wall Panel Transmitter Switch control two different devices connected to the receivers in different places?</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A:Yes,a 2 Gang switch can control different devices apart,like one is upstairs,and another is downstairs.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3.Q:Do I need to make a hole to install the switch?</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A:No, there is no need.You just need a double-sided tape to stick it anywhere you like.And we will provide you with 2 double-sided tapes in the package.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">4.Q:Does this work with Google Home?</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A：Yes,it does.And it’s also compatible with Alexa</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">5.Q:How to install?Is a c-wire required for the switch?</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A:Install the receiver where the device requires,and then control the device through our switch.No c-wire required for the switch.</p>",
