      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Tuya Zigebee Module, DIY 3 Gang Công tắc thông minh, 1 2 Way Circuit Breaker Interruptor</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">Feature</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><span></span>Smart Zigbee module with mini design to suit UK and EU wall switch boxes; compact size allows an easy fit with no changes to your home decor; turns compatible products into smart ones in seconds; allows independent operation of traditional switch with no interference; only suitable for rocker switch (see figure 2 for details)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span></span>3-gang switches supported; can be used as a 1-way or 2-way circuit (2 switches control 1 light); simply connect to 1 of the 2 switches and convert the connected device into a smart one (for 2-way circuit)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span></span>Allows for hands-free voice and wireless remote control;support Amazon Alexa Google Home voice control and Smart Life and Tuya App control on smart phones with special Tuya ZigBee 3.0 hub required and connected.<br></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span></span>Considering the status of unstable network or no network,ZigBee 3.0 switch module is really an irreplaceable must to combine with ZigBee gateway to form a home LAN, NO MORE WORRY about no and weak network, easily get control via connected devices as long as there is stable ZigBee signal; Allows for more devices connected via ZigBee than WiFi protocol.<br></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span></span>Take full control of connected appliances with timers, schedules and countdown (1/5/30 mins, 1 hour, etc.) with Smart Life and Tuya App; share control with family and friends for added convenience; includes full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction.<br></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4><strong>Parameter:</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Input Voltage : 90V~250V / 50Hz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wiring : Live wire and Neutral wire</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Max. Current : 10A</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wi-Fi Standard : 2.4GHz 802.11 b/g/n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>App Name : Tuya Smart/Smart Life</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Size : ( 0.7 * 1.85 * 2.04 ) inch</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Certification: FCC, CE, RoHS</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
