      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES WiFi Smart Water Gas Valve Controller Pipeline Auto Shut OFF</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Main Features:</h4>\n<ol data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></b><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Tuya Smart/Smart Life APP Wireless </b></strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Remote Control</b></strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">:</b></strong>Control farmlands and household appliances for water or gas supply through Smart Life App or Amazon Alexa Smart Home App anytime from anywhere,as long as there is stable networksignal,a really good complement for opening the watering valve to water the farmland,water the garden,and close the gas valve</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></b><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Alexa and Google Home Compatible:</b></strong>The smart valve is compatible with Amazon Alexa and Google Home Assistant, which allows you shut-off/on your water valve via your voicecommand with its wide compatibility with water pipe ball valves, electric, manual control switches, and natural/liquid/tap gas, suitable well for controlling water valves, natural gas valves, filling pools, farm watering plants.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></b><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Work with Smart Water Sensors for Smart Automation:</b></strong>Intelligent linkage the smart valve to the smart water leakage sensor for smart automation as when the water sensor detects water leakage,the valve will automatically close;Meanwhile the smart sensor is also featured with pushing alarm notification in APP when there is the water leakage,together with various intelligent functions and features itself for whole house linkage.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></b><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Timer and Family Sharing:</b></strong>Set a timer schedule to shut ON/OFF the valve controller automatically,as make a schedule for garden sprinkler to water plants automatically at a preset time.Besides,you able to share the control with your family members or friends.Support multiple phones to control one switch or one phone to control multiple valves at the same time;includes full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 class=\"col-md-3\"></h4>\n<h4 class=\"col-md-3\">Specification:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Temperature: -10-65</li>\n<li>Humidity: &lt;95%</li>\n<li>Supply voltage:12V/1A</li>\n<li>Valve pressure:.6MPa</li>\n<li>Torque:30-60kg.cm</li>\n<li>Closing time: 5-10s</li>\n<li>Opening time:5-10s</li>\n<li>Valve specifications: 1 inch, 1.25 inch.</li>\n<li>Application: spanner valve, butterfly valve</li>\n</ul>\n<p> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Package List:</b></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Water/Gas valve controller 1pcs</li>\n<li>Mounting bracket 2pcs</li>\n<li>M6*30 Allen screw 2pcs</li>\n<li>1 inch rubber ring 1pcs</li>\n<li>DC adaptor 1pcs</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nvfnlr1Xkk0rKPJpitycuw8FV-lCu_PB/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">User Manual 1pcs</b></strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"col-md-6\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></b></strong></h4>\n<h4 class=\"col-md-6\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Q&amp;A:</b></strong></h4>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>Q1:</strong></span> Does the water valve controller work with Alexa for voice control?</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>A:</strong></span>Yes,it is compatible with Alexa and Google Home for free voice control.</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>Q2:</strong></span>Can I remotely shut off the valve when I am not at home?</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>A:</strong></span>Yes,it is compatible with Tuya Smart/Smart Life APP for wireless remote control.</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>Q3:</strong></span>Can I timer the schedule for the controller to water my plants at a preset time?</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>A:</strong></span>Yes,there is the timer feature for the valve in the Smart Life APP.</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>Q4:</strong></span>Does it support home automation to other smart home devices?</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>A:</strong></span>Yes,it is featured as smart scene linkage functional,such as water leakage sensor.</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>Q5:</strong></span>Can I use it to control my natural gas valve?</span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>A</strong></span>:Yes,it functions well for water valves, natural gas valves, filling pools, farm watering plants.</span></p>\n<br>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_1_1ceb9a40-88f0-4c2d-979e-a0effcef01e9_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853668\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_2_34d51801-cb5d-4469-9c3c-4bccc3b06104_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853676\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_3_99dea2a9-e9b7-4b10-8149-163876c41edb_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853690\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_5_48c49b6a-43f9-402a-876b-2728fdc53ec5_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853703\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_6_97a1848d-0782-45e1-884c-dffb47a5a167_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853712\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_7_dd5fdf68-6283-4f86-8537-ed7ee6b8b5ba_1024x1024.jpg?v=1650853721\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n</div>",
