      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Wi-Fi Smart IR Remote Control with Temperature and Humidity Sensor for Air Conditioner TV AC</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <strong>Product Features:</strong></p>\n<p>With this Universal IR Remote Control, you may use your smart phone to control home appliances, such as STB(Set-Top-Box), TV Box, TV, Air Conditioner, Fan, DVD, etc. Compatible with most of brands, for details, please refer to the supported brand list in App. Besides, it has DIY CUSTOM LEARNING FUNCTON, allows you to copy the key function of original remote control to App.</p>\n<p>Note: Not compatible with the home appliances which use RF or BLUETOOTH remote control.</p>\n<p><strong>Main Features:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<span></span>Massive IR Code Database with Built-in Temperature &amp; Humidity Sensor:New arrival as 4000+ brands, 50000+ IR Code on cloud and supported devices library is constantly being updated by the cloud;Built-in Temperature &amp; Humidity sensor ensures the clear display on your house condition for its best value,as well as date and time available in LCD screen with all-in-one device.</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Tuya Smart Life App compatible enables wireless remote monitor on your house condition,including temperature and humidity;One gentle touch in App icon to transfer from ℃ and ℉ for added convenience;Add IR devices into Smart Life App for intelligent controls.</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Compatible with Alexa,Google Home and many other third-party devices features its simple voice control with voice command for your connected devices;Extremely fast pairing mode with your phone Bluetooth and 2.4G Wi-Fi on meanwhile for adding the device into App within seconds.</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Scenario and Automation in App:A scenario consists of 1 or more actions. By creating an “Scenario”, you may control multiple devices with one tapunder this T&amp;H sensor; By adding an “Automation” and inter-working with other smart home devices, Wi-Fi remote control is able to execute actions automatically according to conditions, such as device status, weather and time.For example, turn on the air conditioner when the temperature is higher than 26 ℃, and turn on the humidifier when the humidity is less than 50%</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>DIY Custom Learn Functional:Customizing buttons in Tuya Smart App if your home appliances brand is not in the list or not supported;According to your living habits, set time switches for your home appliances, such as turning on/off the air conditioner at regular intervals under Schedule in Tap-to-Run;includes full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15GHM3tRrHW_4EDQMwZVyUHQuX_Vp4fmk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>User manual:</strong></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<h4>Product Parameter:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Input: DC 5V/1A(Micro USB NO Adapter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Infrared Frequency: 38KHz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>LED indicator:Blue</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>IR Remote Control Distance: ≤10m</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Connection: Wi-Fi  2.4GHz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>App: Tuya Smart or Smart Life</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Temperature Measure Range: 0℃-60℃</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Temperature Accuracy: ±1℃</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Humidity Measure Range: 0%RH-99%RH</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Humidity Accuracy: ±5%RH</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Size: 65mm*65mm*17mm</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_features_4c5fcf77-9540-420f-a811-25183d53c4f3.jpg?v=1629803715\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_1_1afd66c5-d86b-43df-bb81-831f329f793f.jpg?v=1630562282\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_2_53dbfbcb-11c5-411d-8ed5-999c8a3be5ff.jpg?v=1630562298\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_3_7ddb791e-5583-4978-84cc-67e2d3a12d37.jpg?v=1630562310\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_4_29087cd0-c8fe-4bc3-8acd-88b8a030dadb.jpg?v=1630562322\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_5_ee4575aa-e5a7-47be-9a71-23eb4e9b96ff.jpg?v=1630562337\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_6_8a58f8cc-7116-4cb8-b152-bdb6c315fd1d.jpg?v=1630562358\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>",
