      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Smart Programmable Radiator Actuator Valve Tuya ZigBee3.0 Round Screen Thermostat Temperature Controller</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Main Features:<br>\n</h4>\n<p><strong><b>1.</b></strong><strong><b>New Soft Touching Design with Humanized Upgrades:</b></strong>New mini elegant design with extremely clear LED data display on its body and wider perspective for easy reading; two sections of AA batteries powered,which is a special valve using cooperatively with heating radiator to control the closing and opening of the pipe for more comfortable room temperature.</p>\n<p><strong><b>2.A Tuya ZigBee Wireless Gateway Hub is a Must :</b></strong> A ZigBee wireless hub is a must that connects to the valve many other ZigBee smart products and realizes the whole linkage of your smart home devices.Simply add your gateway to the App,then add your radiator actuator to your gateway in the Smart Life App,even smart automation to other smart devices in APP by creating various scenes for flexible controls on smart phones.</p>\n<p><strong><b>3.External Sensor Design for More Accurate Measurement:</b></strong>Functional extremely well with external sensor on the valve that provides accurate readings for house temperature,ensures much more convenient and intelligent control to your smart  lifestyle with intelligent control on smart phones with Smart Life App supported.Eco temperature and low battery notification ensures a real-sense of low power consumption for the best value of this new arrival.</p>\n<p><strong><b>4</b></strong><strong><b>.Programmable Schedule with Weekly Programming Selection:</b></strong>Supports manual set up 5+2, 7 days weekly schedule with 5 periods for option ,providing you with the maximum convenience for different situation and setting customized schedule for your house temperature.Holiday mode,automatic mode, and manual mode available for added convenience;Window open detection and offset temperature are both featured for this TRV controller for added convenience.</p>\n<p><strong><b>5</b></strong><strong><b>.Voice and Remote Control for the Tuya ZigBee Wireless Gateway:</b></strong>Supports App remote control via your smart phone,together with the hands-free voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant after successfully connecting your valve to Tuya /Smart Life App on the basis of one Tuya ZigBee Wireless Gateway;Long time standby for this new device with 1.5-year featured;Full 2 Years Warranty,for All MOES Smart Thermostat,60 Days Refund Guarantee,Your complete satisfaction is MOES goal for all its customers.</p>\n<p><strong>Parameter:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Batteries: 2×1.5 V LR6/mignon/AA</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Battery life: 1.5 years</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Temperature range: 5-30°C</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Degree of protection: Ip20</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Display: LCD with LED</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>RF: ZigBee</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Frequency: 2.4GHz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Maximum radiated power: 10dBm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dimensions(W xHx D): 55.3×54×98.3 mm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Weight: 190g(ind. batteries)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Working temperature: -10°C~40°C</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Working environment: Indoor</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Safety: CE/ROHS</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Package List:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>1 ZigBee Radiator Thermostat</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>2 1.5V mignon/LR6/AA batteries</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>1 Adapters for Danfoss(RA, RAV and RAVL)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>1 Screw for adapter</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>1 Operating manual</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_features_d6e006af-f486-4cb9-8fa4-ab4e630104cf.jpg?v=1627542043\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_1_12d0ab93-8a83-47e4-9f37-3c832afac68a.jpg?v=1628751121\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_2_e292ffcc-b746-4ae4-a64e-de00db4db091.jpg?v=1628751141\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_3_eeba15aa-bac3-47ef-b1b3-03166756f003.jpg?v=1628751156\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_4_20823fc5-8661-41d5-a866-3aa3246f130b.jpg?v=1628751225\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_5_20d651b7-403b-401a-9e88-b31beb9f174a.jpg?v=1628751255\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/657a10cffd3f688478b05195f01e9763_62e94287-9b75-4739-8040-b755f65b9189.jpg?v=1628751277\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>",
