      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES Smart Home Solutions Customization</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h1>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/02b457e75c948ad71a7d09750d27b04c.jpg?v=1627442971\"></div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>Note:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>1.Choose one of the kit below for conveninece to purchase directly.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>2.If any items you want to delete or replace with other items for the kit you choose,contact us at services@moeshouse.com for your idea.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>3.If you do not know anything about your house decoration,contact us at services@moeshouse.com and we will customize a suitable plan for your whole house decoration with $150 consulting and designed fee charged.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>4.If your final order is over $500,you just do not need to pay the consulting and design fee.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e41f1f;\"><strong>5.If your final order is less than $500,you would need to pay the consulting and design fee with $150 for a customized plan.</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>HOME AUTOMATION AND SMART HOME SYSTEMS OF EXCELLENCE </strong></p>\n<p>A Smart Home should enhance your lifestyle, not complicate it. If you’re a home owner, architect, developer or designer planning a new home or renovation, partnering with MOES Smart Home Solutions is a smart move.</p>\n<p>We are a full-service residential and commercial custom electronics design and integration company. Our smart home automation solutions make your home safe, elegant, fun and easy to use. Business experience increased productivity, enhanced environment for employees and customers, and simple control from commercial automation. Our team is comprised of skilled experts whose number one priority is to provide the best products and services to our clients.</p>\n<p><strong>PARTNERING WITH SMART HOME SOLUTIONS </strong></p>\n<p>Creating a smart home involves the bringing together of many different disciplines including entertainment, lighting, security and networking to name just a few. That’s what MOES Smart Home Solutions does best, and our industry-leading design and documentation process simplifies it all, saving you time and money.</p>\n<p><strong>SMART HOME SOLUTIONS – YOUR TECHNOLOGY PARTNER</strong></p>\n<p>Find out more about our smart solutions for: MOES Smart Home Solution is a great provider of products, solutions, and technologies that help homeowners stay connected and have control over their comfort, security, and energy usage of their homes that comes for a real-sense of whole-house linkage with intelligence.</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>Style 1:What if there is a scene switch as a bridge for your all?</strong></span></h1>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/6f3836db06ed34f2566257a43d8da1e2.jpg?v=1627023771\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/3fc91499570af2d0ae1a5fa38e0d5c0e.jpg?v=1627023752\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/4bbc9f1041c46048a51dc275eb9ff62e.jpg?v=1627023706\"></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #e1a40b;\"><strong>Style 2:What if choosing various smart devices to meet different smart scenes?</strong></span></h1>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/81c32de429c9db8c22b40eee2333398e.jpg?v=1627367730\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/d34e3e70a452e9e5e8592109908c432f_5c1e7380-65a7-44a9-99f8-fa310ff37c91.jpg?v=1627372012\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/094eb1622d1cd099c923879f6a0b9878_fa2010cb-3b37-4e89-b552-5dda07548738.jpg?v=1627376194\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/cd579d952a77f2fd72050ca8a98ae8ff.jpg?v=1627367710\"></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\">Style 3:Contact us for your special idea.</h1>\n<p> </p>",
