      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES BLE Smart Sprinkler Water Timer with Rain Delay Filter Washer Programmable Irrigation Timer</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Main Features:<br>\n</h4>\n<p>1. Remote Control and Smart Watering: Water hose timer design with Bluetooth 5.0, easy and convenient scheduling through the app within a range of 49.2ft(without interference); Smart hose timer allows you to water on minutes, hours, specific days of the week; Always keep your watering time setting, even when the signal goes down, there's no need to reset your schedules</p>\n<p>2. Muti-Functional with 3 Modes: Auto, manual watering and rain delay featured in Smart Life App. The rain delay feature allows you to postpone watering for 24 hours, 48 hours or 72 hours due to rain; Meanwhile, the manual watering feature will shift from automatic to manual watering via the app or pressing the button without disturbing the programmed schedule; Fit for palms, vegetable garden and potted flowers.</p>\n<p>3. Bluetooth Gateway Hub Required for Added Convenience: This Bluetooth water timer is designed with Bluetooth protocol for single-adding devices into the Smart Life App with smartphone Bluetooth on. More importantly, is Bluetooth gateway required to be added for stabler wireless remote control and irrigation history in the Tuya Smart App. Smartphones Bluetooth is only featured as connecting devices and operating preset timers, with no more extra intelligent controls.</p>\n<p>4. Upgraded Leak-Proof Design: The connectors of the smart sprinkler timer are made of 30% reinforced nylon material, which can withstand water pressures of 2.9 psi and up to 116 psi with IP55 waterproof standard reached. It's a perfect outdoor water timer for drip irrigation, water sprinklers, hose faucets or rain barrels.</p>\n<p>5. Simple to Setup and Use: No need for tools, simply fit the timer onto the tap/faucet and connect the hose attachment to the male snap-on connector, that's it! The faucet timer with 2 1.5V AA batteries can run up to 6 months saving water and energy in a real sense; includes a full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction.</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_features_35b79672-421f-4cc5-9e3b-785253b84c4f.jpg?v=1626179541\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_1_5023b107-3bcc-4681-b0d9-edb78ae3c043.jpg?v=1626179564\" alt=\"Smart Life App for Timely Control of Plants Irrigation\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_2_a4ba4777-7263-40fb-89e8-3cc1fdd8e72f.jpg?v=1626179580\" alt=\"Multiple Usage-Remote Control within 50ft\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_3_beddf8b3-01d5-4c76-8da2-0e00e7cf10d7.jpg?v=1626179594\" alt=\"One Button to Choose Manual Irrigation Function.\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_4_d9cf54f3-9291-4873-ba08-02425bf7f6a1.jpg?v=1626179611\" alt=\"App control / Rain delay / Timer schedule / Water proof / Ultraviolet proof / Manual watering\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/dca3527c75cbd6f4e37a2ed5c742b2e6.jpg?v=1626179654\" alt=\"without Bluetooth Hub( APP Control - Smart Water Timer-Can only be controlled nearby)\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"></div>",
