"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/01_09_65c3989c-ac7c-4425-87b9-5cbd1c90c65f.jpg?v=1601449532\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/01_10_e8c876fc-0b16-4c09-b4e2-c67ae228b6dd.jpg?v=1601449548\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_10_ce5e98fd-2086-46e4-ae06-f559f87ad6fc.jpg?v=1601449656\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<p>Q&amp;A:</p>\n<p>1.Q: Can i install the track to the wall?</p>\n<p>A: Sure,the ceiling mount tracker and wall mount bracket will be included in the package for you to install freely. </p>\n<p>2.Q: Could I open the curtain from middle or from left to right?</p>\n<p>A: Yes, it allows  to open to curtains from right to left, from left to right or from middle to both sides,you can just install them to your own need. </p>\n<p>3.Q: I need a double track, what should i do?</p>\n<p>A: You should get 2 set of it to make a double track, however, kindly leaves us message if u would like install double track to the wall, it need a special bracket.</p>\n<p>4.Q:Does it work with Samsung smartthings?</p>\n<p>A:No,this is the WiFi Tuya version and no hub required for it.And you can control it via Alexa for voice control. </p>",
