      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES 3/4 Gang, 1/2 Way Module, Wireless Home Công tắc thông minh Light Modular</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/slogon_600x600.png?v=1652332880\"></p>\n<p> <strong>Main Features:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<span></span>Smart Wi-Fi module with mini design to suit UK and EU wall switch boxes; compact size allows an easy fit with no changes to your home decor; turns compatible products into smart ones in seconds; allows independent operation of traditional switch with no interference; only suitable for rocker switch (see figure 2 for details)</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>3/4-gang switches supported; can be used as a 1-way or 2-way circuit (2 switches control 1 light); simply connect to 1 of the 2 switches and convert the connected device into a smart one (for 2-way circuit)</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Allows for hands-free voice and wireless remote control; compatible with Alexa Echo and Google Home; remotely control devices with your smart phone wherever you are, even when you're away from home;memory function with on/off/remember last status supported in Smart Life Tuya App.</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Take full control of connected appliances with timers, schedules and countdown (1/5/30 mins, 1 hour, etc.) with the app; share control with family and friends for added convenience.</li>\n<li>\n<span></span>Control with your smart phone via MOES/Tuya app without a separate hub; a much easier pairing mode for adding the device with WiFi and Bluetooth connected;includes full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Product type:3/4 Gang WiFi Switch Module</li>\n<li>WiFi frequency:2.4GHz WIFI</li>\n<li>Operation temp.:-10ºC - +40ºC</li>\n<li>Case temp.:Tc: +80ºC (Max.)</li>\n<li>Operation range:≤ 200 m</li>\n<li>Dims (WxDxH):52x47x22 mm</li>\n<li>IP rating:IP20</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jMpsXbWCgWtGEHKuncvY3fqepHo38adc/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">User Manual</a></p>\n<p><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_features_78a2a825-7b7b-40bf-84dc-5eff7555425f.jpg?v=1597995589\"><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/1_dd6b0811-4116-49b7-a5f4-985e3784d35d.jpg?v=1630477366\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/2_e68d7ac4-63dc-4fd5-88a9-372b4474d847.jpg?v=1630477381\" style=\"float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/4_340367f5-3216-4eb9-921e-498888ac1f14.jpg?v=1648515969\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/4_340367f5-3216-4eb9-921e-498888ac1f14.jpg?v=1648515969\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_1_185fde36-7c5b-4907-bbb2-72dc4e7e5676.jpg?v=1630477395\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_2_8e047940-7703-45db-bea5-17a4aeba145d.jpg?v=1630477415\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_3_1104e5dd-2ce7-4d42-97f0-dac688dc453d.jpg?v=1630477432\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_4_fd9f0e67-a761-4ae7-9e5d-340a92b8e3bc.jpg?v=1630477486\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_5_d7477de6-e9a6-432f-b231-8c908b9b1850.jpg?v=1630477503\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<p> </p>",
