      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES WiFi Smart Light Push Button Switch Neutral Wire Optional Capacitor required 220-240V EU</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/slogon_600x600.png?v=1652332880\"><br></p>\n<h4>Main Features: </h4>\n<p>1.Single live wire design with no neutral wire; uses fire-retardant material and no electric arc technology to ensure safe, reliable use with no overloading or overheating</p>\n<p>2.Hands-Free Voice Control:Compatible with Amazon Alexa and Google Home for easy voice control.</p>\n<p>3.Wi-Fi/4G Remote Control:Take Command of Your Lights Using The “Smart Life or Tuya” App (iOS Or Android) Anytime or Anywhere.The App Can Be Easily Shared with Multiple Family Members.</p>\n<p>4.Take full control of connected appliances with timers, schedules, and countdowns (1/5/30 mins, 1 hour, etc.) with the app; share control with family and friends for added convenience</p>\n<p>5.No neutral wire required; <span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">supports 2.4 GHz network; includes full 2-year warranty and 60-day refund guarantee for complete satisfaction.</span></p>\n<h4>Parameter:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Switch Type:Push Button Switch</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Model Number:WS-EU-PLW</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Current:10A</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Type:86 WiFi Smart Switch</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Rated Current:10A Max.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Rated Voltage:220-240VAC 50/60Hz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Capacitive Load:200W/Gang</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wireless Frequency:2.4GHz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wireless Standard:IEEE802.11b/g/n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>APP:Smart Life/Tuya</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eFmVyGupScYMW8LvBYldkpn73-19do4E/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">User Manual</a>:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_display_0138335e-2af8-4275-bc57-6e21f91df517.jpg?v=1593568627\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/Wi-Fi_smart_switch_ab96a803-08a3-43c8-8f0a-29da9c2e0a64.jpg?v=1594369442\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/1_f2c8ea5e-dc28-4790-9cd4-1d75b56437e7.jpg?v=1594369475\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/4a752148a471fe0cfc68ea538f846478.jpg?v=1594370571\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>",
