      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES RF433 Remote Emitter For Controlling WiFi /ZigBee Curtain Motor</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h3><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/slogon_600x600.png?v=1652332880\"></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>Main Features：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>1.Hand-held protable remote:</strong>Various channels available with RF433 built -in as single,double,six and sixteen channels,also black and white color optional,easily controlling your curtains anywhere you like in the house.</p>\n<p><strong>2.Wall-mounted remote:</strong>Simply stick the crystal type emitter on the wall with double side tape to control the WiFi/ZigBee curtain motor in a much easier way.Single and double type optional with white color suitable for any decoration styles.</p>\n<p>3.RF433 frequency for controlling our curtain motor track and tubular motor at the same time;this two versions of the remote are designed for controlling our new upgraded curtain control system in a much more powerful way;easily achieve the whole control to the whole house curtains with them.<strong>(You need to pair with the motor you want before the control)</strong></p>\n<p>4.Our curtain motor track or tubular motor can only be controlled with this kind of remote,no other types of RF433 remote available.</p>\n<p>5.Battery powered:3V(CR2032) twist button battery required for hand-held remote,and 27A(12V) for wall-mounted remote.<strong>(Battery not included in the package restricted by the shipping)</strong></p>\n<h3>Package listing:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>1*Remote(channes and colors optional)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:battery not included.</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_display_0138335e-2af8-4275-bc57-6e21f91df517.jpg?v=1593568627\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_1_ec43cc0c-9cbe-4742-ae3d-500a49fb1d92.jpg?v=1597650782\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_2_617420f1-60a5-4df1-b100-f03b431f8eae.jpg?v=1597650813\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_3_aabbdf52-c370-4443-9a8a-a6c152655411.jpg?v=1597650833\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_4_f1211ba0-e1c9-4c5f-9b12-47ceca0d151b.jpg?v=1597650852\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/a_2_d434e7dc-e776-4f91-9523-946038dba520.jpg?v=1597650882\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>",
