      "description": "<div class='moes-luxury-badge'>⭐ DÒNG CAO CẤP MOES SMART HOME (HỆ SINH THÁI TUYA & HASS LOCAL)</div><p><strong>MOES WiFi Smart Clock Wake Up 7 Colors Light Natural Sound Clock With FM Radio</strong> là thiết bị nhà thông minh cao cấp chính hãng MOES, kết nối đồng bộ 100% qua chuẩn Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / WiFi với hệ thống Tuya Smart, Smart Life và Home Assistant (HASS).</p><ul><li>Chuẩn giao thức: Zigbee 3.0 / Matter / Tuya BLE Mesh</li><li>Tương thích tuyệt đối: Home Assistant (Z2M/ZHA), Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa</li><li>Vật liệu hoàn thiện: Kính cường lực cao cấp, viền hợp kim CNC sang trọng</li><li>Bảo hành: 24 tháng 1 đổi 1 tận nơi bởi Chu Gia Security</li></ul><!-- more -->\n<h4>Main Features:<br>\n</h4>\n<p><strong>1. Hands-free Voice Control:</strong> The new 2nd Generation smart wake-up light is compatible with Amazon Alexa, and Google Home which enables it to work with voice commands, no cable is needed, just requires 2.4GHz WiFi to operate with much more convenience and fun. Easily free your hands in a smarter way.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Smart App Control:</strong> The new 2nd Generation smart wake-up light is redesigned with Tuya/Smart Life App functions. The Smart Life/Tuya smart app helps to connect your smart wake-up light to your home's 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi. You can conveniently control it anytime from anywhere. All functions of the wake-up light can be configured on the App intelligently, which transforms your wake-up light into a smart one,as long as you add the device to your smart Life app account successfully.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Sunrise/Sunset Simulation Alarm Clock:</strong> Select the time you want to wake up and let your gentle sunrise keep you refreshed. From 10 to 60 minutes before the selected wake-up time, the light will turn on and will initially be very soft, gradually becoming brighter and brighter. And sleep with a dimming sunset. You can adjust the brightness from 5% to 100% to your own need. The automatic adjustment mode of the brightness leaves no more trouble or worry about the bright light that hurts your eyes to some extent.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Alarm Clock with Snooze Feature: </strong>The new 2nd generation comes with 4 alarms and can be set 4 different times on the same day.The new added two alarms with the choice of setting workday and weekend alarms separately, allowing you to set the free alarm time to your own needs and preferences. Besides, the snooze function allows 8-15 extra minutes of sleep before alerting you again, which caters to a smart humanized one.</p>\n<p><strong>5. 7 Natural Sounds and FM Radio:</strong> Our wake-up alarm clock comes with 7 kinds of sounds to choose to wake up with comfortably, such as pure music, birds, forest, waves, beeping and even FM radio optional, just long-press the FM button for 2 secs until it stars and then you are able to automatically scan all stations, at the range of 76-108.0MHz. It helps you wake up more naturally than the loud blared regular alarm with this new updated wake-up light.</p>\n<h4>Parameter:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Display: LED display</li>\n<li>Light Brightness: Level 20</li>\n<li>Light Color: 7</li>\n<li>Volume Level: 16</li>\n<li>Display Brightness: 4</li>\n<li>Alarms: 4</li>\n<li>Alarm Sounds: 7&amp;FM Radio</li>\n<li>Sunrise Simulation: 60 minutes</li>\n<li>Snooze: 8-15minutes</li>\n<li>Snooze Time:5times</li>\n<li>FM Radio: 76.0-108MHz</li>\n<li>Material: ABS+PC</li>\n<li>Battery Type: CR2032</li>\n<li>Battery Capacity: 220mAh</li>\n<li>Input Voltage: 100-240V</li>\n<li>USB Output: 5V 2A</li>\n<li>Size: Diameter 16.5*16.5*6cm</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Package Listing:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>1*wake-up light clock</li>\n<li>1*user manual</li>\n<li>1*USB cable</li>\n<li>2*stands</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TrE_AEiqtHTYZBHoDL2zK8cDiSX8Sy1c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">User Manual:</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/product_display_4774ff9b-0041-4cd0-9bec-60ca113501b8.jpg?v=1585271961\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"Automatic Time Display\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_1_59840db7-f869-4985-a91c-a34ffa545080.jpg?v=1585284911\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"The new stand design makes it work much stabler\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_2_d2017cb5-63b3-41bd-af89-b8ece61974c8.jpg?v=1585284945\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"Four Alarm Clocks\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_3_9733c134-2cff-4a3a-bc70-e5eeefb8331b.jpg?v=1585284964\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"Individually control of group control available\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/A_4_8a5d49fb-872c-45cc-817f-258dee95a204.jpg?v=1585285037\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"Upgrades and Advantages\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/13731b67541234aa6ed0a095c8508a73.jpg?v=1585285098\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" alt=\"Press the snooze button after turning off the wake up light,then the night  light will be very dark that protect your eyes.\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0095/4079/6497/files/f545cefb2b8c4708140952e388870ec5.jpg?v=1585285154\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<h4>Q&amp;A:</h4>\n<p>1. Q: Does this clock get completely dark at night except for the time? Or does it have a glow that may keep some people awake?</p>\n<p>A: Yes, the brightness of the clock is adjustable and can be turned off at night. And the new 2nd generation one even allows automatic adjustment of the brightness according to the surrounding brightness.</p>\n<p>2. Q: Can I make the wake-up light go completely dark?</p>\n<p>A: Yes, there is an option to dim or turn off the light for the clock display, and you are able to smartly set on your smartphone after you add it to your Smart Life app account.</p>\n<p>3. Q: Can I charge my phone with the clock?</p>\n<p>A: Yes, there is a USB port on the back with 5V 2A for you to charge your phone conveniently.</p>\n<p>4. Q: How does this especially differ from the other wake-up lights on Amazon?Does it have any new features or functions than others?</p>\n<p>A: Yes, of course. This new 2nd generation is a smart one redesigned with much more features than the old one. Especially all the functions of it can be configured in the Smart Life App to control it with more convenience. It even attaches more consideration to the actual needs of people and avoids many drawbacks of the original one to leave a more enjoyable using experience to your smart life.</p>",
